    "tag": "v24.0.0",
    "name": "Feature Foundry V24 \u2014 Native Living World",
    "body": "## Feature Foundry V24 \u2014 Native Living World\n\nA complete TypeScript + Rust/Tauri living-world studio preserving the exact V24 contract and adding a GPU-accelerated Three.js world, verified V33 and artist-world catalogs, native SQLite, real media surfaces, object ecology, and provider-aware room soundtracks.\n\n### Verified systems\n- Exact V24 body, CSS, runtime, classes, wording, data attributes, and behavior contract\n- 17 approved V33 themes, 34 rooms, 85 ecology objects\n- 10 current artist worlds, 20 districts, 21 exact music routes\n- Frutiger Aero and ornate Frawgy living-world presentations at 1536\u00d71024\n- Spotify PKCE desktop loopback, MusicKit v3, and real external adapters for all six providers\n- Local/direct/YouTube Living Screen Studio with animated TV idle channel\n- Native SQLite integrity and exact seed counts verified from the release executable\n\n### Artifacts\n- Complete release bundle containing every artifact below\n- Windows x64 NSIS setup executable\n- Windows x64 MSI installer\n- Portable production web build\n- Complete source bundle\n- SHA-256 checksum manifest\n\nThe Windows binaries are release-optimized but not Authenticode-signed, so Windows may show a publisher/reputation prompt.",
